    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>ModernPress Addons provides a suite of Elementor widgets designed to enhance the functionality and aesthetics of your WordPress website. Whether you need advanced design elements, interactive sections, or better content structuring, this plugin helps you achieve a professional look effortlessly.</p>\n<p><strong>Features:</strong><br />\n✔ 16+ Custom Elementor Widgets<br />\n✔ Fully Responsive &amp; Mobile-Friendly<br />\n✔ Lightweight &amp; Optimized for Speed<br />\n✔ No Coding Required<br />\n✔ Regular Updates &amp; New Widgets</p>\n<p>Some of the widgets included:<br />\n• Posts<br />\n• Categories<br />\n• Search<br />\n• Client Logos<br />\n• Cards<br />\n• Testimonials<br />\n• Team Members<br />\n• Accordions<br />\n• Social Media Icons<br />\n• Image Gallery<br />\n• Image Slider<br />\n• Tables<br />\n• Tabs<br />\n• …More widgets to be added soon!</p>\n<p>Start designing with <strong>ModernPress Addons</strong> and make your website stand out! 🚀</p>\n<h3>Support &amp; Documentation</h3>\n<p>For support, visit our website: <a href=\"https://modernpress.io\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://modernpress.io</a></p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li><strong>Upload via WordPress:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>Go to Plugins <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Add New.  </li>\n<li>Search for &#8220;ModernPress Addons.&#8221;  </li>\n<li>Click &#8220;Install Now&#8221; and activate.  </li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Manual Upload:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>Upload the <code>modernpress-addons</code> folder to <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code>.  </li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; screen in WordPress.  </li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Open Elementor and start using the new widgets under <strong>ModernPress Addons</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='does%20this%20plugin%20require%20elementor%20pro%3F'>\nDoes this plugin require Elementor Pro?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>No, <strong>ModernPress Addons</strong> works with both the free and pro versions of Elementor.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='will%20this%20slow%20down%20my%20website%3F'>\nWill this slow down my website?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>No. The plugin is built for performance and does not add unnecessary bloat.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='can%20i%20use%20this%20with%20any%20wordpress%20theme%3F'>\nCan I use this with any WordPress theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes! It is compatible with any Elementor-compatible theme.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release with 20+ custom Elementor widgets.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "ModernPress Addons is a collection of powerful widgets for Elementor to enhance your website&#039;s design and functionality.",
    "description": "<p>ModernPress Addons provides a suite of Elementor widgets designed to enhance the functionality and aesthetics of your WordPress website. Whether you need advanced design elements, interactive sections, or better content structuring, this plugin helps you achieve a professional look effortlessly.</p>\n<p><strong>Features:</strong><br />\n✔ 16+ Custom Elementor Widgets<br />\n✔ Fully Responsive &amp; Mobile-Friendly<br />\n✔ Lightweight &amp; Optimized for Speed<br />\n✔ No Coding Required<br />\n✔ Regular Updates &amp; New Widgets</p>\n<p>Some of the widgets included:<br />\n• Posts<br />\n• Categories<br />\n• Search<br />\n• Client Logos<br />\n• Cards<br />\n• Testimonials<br />\n• Team Members<br />\n• Accordions<br />\n• Social Media Icons<br />\n• Image Gallery<br />\n• Image Slider<br />\n• Tables<br />\n• Tabs<br />\n• …More widgets to be added soon!</p>\n<p>Start designing with <strong>ModernPress Addons</strong> and make your website stand out! 🚀</p>\n<h3>Support &amp; Documentation</h3>\n<p>For support, visit our website: <a href=\"https://modernpress.io\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://modernpress.io</a></p>\n",
    "download_link": "https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/modernpress-addons.1.0.0.zip",
